#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:1 e07354418f964dbbba61b07cc664b40b
msgid "DFT-D3：统一数据中的色散校正口径"
msgstr "DFT-D3: Make the Dispersion-Correction Convention Consistent"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:3 9463108adb03496fbdfefd331209a970
msgid ""
"这个功能直接修改当前数据集的 DFT 参考标签，用于加上或减去 DFT-D3 色散校正。只有明确知道原始数据是否包含 "
"D3、使用了什么交换关联泛函时才运行；不确定时不要靠散点图位置猜。"
msgstr ""
"This operation directly modifies the DFT reference labels in the current "
"dataset by adding or subtracting a DFT-D3 dispersion correction. Run it "
"only when you know whether the source data already include D3 and which "
"exchange-correlation functional was used. Do not infer this from the "
"scatter plot."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 3fdd3d35853f4775bbddaea36b75cd6b
msgid "当前数据"
msgstr "Current data"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md ac9a0b6f5fcb4dde8f832416454ad923
msgid "目标口径"
msgstr "Target convention"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md e7224fd1f137467fa3a2d9d1907de9cc
msgid "选择"
msgstr "Choose"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md de9dcf9bf5544174b39b005ce1dfe658
msgid "不含 D3"
msgstr "Without D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md e60e97bff42d4082ab2f1501451dcaa3
msgid "改成包含 D3"
msgstr "Include D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md ac8f0ac1fd214a4e8de6415267bf6742
#
msgid "`加上 DFT-D3`"
msgstr "`Add DFT-D3`"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 1c59362cef8342eb943680facd878813
msgid "已含 D3"
msgstr "With D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 1c8536cff7fd4b4c969d9ca5f507c1f9
msgid "改成不含 D3"
msgstr "Remove D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md ac8f0ac1fd214a4e8de6415267bf6742
#
msgid "`减去 DFT-D3`"
msgstr "`Subtract DFT-D3`"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:10
#: cb6c2271279446868b3492f152cd84ed
msgid "1. 先保存原始数据"
msgstr "1. Save the original data first"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:12
#: 2f6fac6591ca4bdfb3ccd32cf0d1d6e0
msgid ""
"在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中打开数据和对应的 `nep.txt`，确认当前标签来源与泛函，然后先导出一份原始数据。DFT-D3 会修改 "
"energy、force 以及已有的 virial/stress 标签，而且重复运行会继续累加，没有单独的撤销按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Open the dataset and its corresponding `nep.txt` in `NEP Dataset "
"Display`, confirm the source and functional of the current labels, and "
"export a copy of the original data. DFT-D3 modifies energy, force, and "
"any existing virial/stress labels. Repeating the operation accumulates "
"the correction, and there is no dedicated undo button."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:14
#: 28f5853dd688494680b54243607f0dda
msgid "能量图和 DFT-D3 校正入口"
msgstr "Energy plot and the DFT-D3 correction action"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:14
#: 28f5853dd688494680b54243607f0dda
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:19
#: ffdc46739bff45109b09a273deced41a
msgid "点击工具栏中的 `DFT D3`。该计算固定使用 CPU，与当前选择的 NEP 后端无关。"
msgstr ""
"Click `DFT D3` on the toolbar. This calculation always runs on the CPU, "
"regardless of the selected NEP backend."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:21
#: c3bca13e5c994f268e1f3a1da2aae67c
msgid "2. 泛函必须与原计算一致"
msgstr "2. Match the functional used by the original calculation"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:23
#: e6b3f8ec9c1e4bc7b063665e6af3dad1
msgid "DFT-D3 校正设置窗口"
msgstr "DFT-D3 correction settings"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:23
#: e6b3f8ec9c1e4bc7b063665e6af3dad1
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_dftd3_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_dftd3_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:28
#: bc295a2663cb4a55a8ef3fa087b9afdd
msgid "图中 `pbe` 只对应 PBE 数据："
msgstr "The `pbe` setting shown here applies only to PBE data:"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:30
#: 2972489e6f8346f2a814b46d2a2ca737
msgid "第一项填写原始 DFT 计算使用的泛函，例如 `pbe`、`scan` 或 `pbesol`。"
msgstr ""
"In the first field, enter the functional used by the original DFT "
"calculation, such as `pbe`, `scan`, or `pbesol`."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:31
#: 9fe90b315f0e4f8c920c5084b4020bb1
#
msgid "`D3 截断半径` 和 `D3 cutoff_cn` 第一次先保留当前默认值；只有已有计算规范明确要求时才修改。"
msgstr "Keep the current defaults for `D3 cutoff` and `D3 cutoff_cn` on your first run. Change them only when an established calculation protocol explicitly requires different values."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:32
#: 6e49f0838cb54199a862aab0f977a91d
#
msgid "按目标选择 `加上 DFT-D3` 或 `减去 DFT-D3`。"
msgstr "Choose `Add DFT-D3` or `Subtract DFT-D3` according to the target convention."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:33
#: 524fdb01e65f4a72824b52cb8679ec5e
msgid "点击 `OK`，等待全部结构处理完成。"
msgstr "Click `OK` and wait for all structures to be processed."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:35
#: f7adc55b71264a2f8bba5cbccff5788d
msgid "不要因为模型使用了某种泛函就填写那个名称；这里应与当前 DFT 标签的原始计算口径一致。"
msgstr ""
"Do not enter a functional merely because the model uses it. This field "
"must match the convention of the original DFT labels in the current "
"dataset."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:37
#: e1627bdfdd0c45559c82ccd89e0419b3
msgid "3. 看标签是否按预期改变"
msgstr "3. Check that the labels changed as intended"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:39
#: b4fc8786c59845d7b079a7080dc68865
msgid "加上 PBE DFT-D3 后的能量图"
msgstr "Energy plot after adding PBE DFT-D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:39
#: b4fc8786c59845d7b079a7080dc68865
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:44
#: c6de10315b214252a03be0fa815f3050
msgid ""
"本例真实加上了 PBE DFT-D3，因此参考能量、力和 virial 发生变化，NEP "
"预测本身没有改变。散点更靠近或更远离对角线都不能单独证明操作正确；关键是模式、泛函和原数据口径是否匹配。"
msgstr ""
"This example applies a real PBE DFT-D3 correction, so the reference "
"energy, force, and virial change while the NEP predictions remain "
"unchanged. Points moving closer to or farther from the diagonal does not "
"by itself prove that the operation is correct. What matters is whether "
"the mode, functional, and source-data convention match."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:46
#: bcbcea763d8d47c999b23cc9da03be39
msgid "检查完成后用新文件名导出，例如 `train_pbe_d3.xyz`。不要覆盖无法重新获得的原始标签。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the result, export it under a new name such as "
"`train_pbe_d3.xyz`. Do not overwrite original labels that cannot be "
"reproduced."

#~ msgid "`Subtract DFT-D3`"
#~ msgstr "`Subtract DFT-D3`"
